<title>AUSTRIA: Austria March jobless rate steady at 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria March jobless rate steady at 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator detail on Thursday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	MARCH 97    FEB 97   MARCH 96</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce     4.1	    4.1	 3.9</p>
<p> Total			    252,005    289,276    263,879</p>
<p>NOTE - The March and February 1997 figures were calculated according to European Union standards. The March 1996 figure is not directly comparable. The March 1997 figure is an extrapolation by the Austrian Labour Market Service from final Eurostat data for January.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
